#===============================================================================
#  ARDHANARISHVARA OS — ENGINEERING SUPPORT DOCUMENT
#  SovereignOS Kernel Telemetry Engine
#  File: kernel_telemetry_engine.support
#===============================================================================
#  PURPOSE:
#    Engineering reference for the SovereignOS telemetry engine responsible for:
#      • kernel metrics
#      • event logging
#      • subsystem health scoring
#      • telemetry packet export
#
#===============================================================================
#  MODULE SUMMARY:
#
#    - [Metrics](ca://s?q=Explain_Kernel_Metrics)
#    - [Event Logging](ca://s?q=Explain_Kernel_Event_Logging)
#    - [Health Scoring](ca://s?q=Explain_Kernel_Health_Scoring)
#    - [Telemetry Export](ca://s?q=Explain_Kernel_Telemetry_Export)
#    - [Snapshot System](ca://s?q=Explain_Kernel_Telemetry_Snapshots)
#
#===============================================================================
#  FUNCTION OVERVIEW:
#
#    - metric(name, value)
#         Sets metric gauge.
#
#    - increment(name, amount)
#         Increments metric counter.
#
#    - event(subsystem, message, meta)
#         Records kernel event.
#
#    - set_health(subsystem, status)
#         Assigns subsystem health.
#
#    - export()
#         Exports telemetry packet.
#
#    - snapshot()
#         Returns full telemetry state.
#
#===============================================================================
#  TELEMETRY PACKET FORMAT:
#
#    {
#      "packet_id": "TLM-XXXX",
#      "metrics": { "cpu.load": 0.42 },
#      "events": [ ... ],
#      "health": { "network": "ok" }
#    }
#
